<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Hospital Universitario Esperanza</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 40px; background-color: #f0f4f8;">

    <div style="background: white; padding: 25px; border-radius: 8px; max-width: 500px; margin: auto; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
        <h1 style="color: #004b87;">Bienvenido al Hospital Universitario Esperanza</h1>
        <p style="font-size: 18px;">¿Ya se presentó a consulta?</p>
        
        <br>
        <button onclick="document.getElementById('form-ticket').style.display='block'" style="background-color: #28a745; color: white; border: none; padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; border-radius: 5px; cursor: pointer;">Sí</button>
        
        <a href="/secretaria">
            <button style="background-color: #dc3545; color: white; border: none; padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; border-radius: 5px; cursor: pointer; margin-left: 10px;">No</button>
        </a>

        <div id="form-ticket" style="display: none; margin-top: 25px; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; padding-top: 15px;">
            <h3>Ingrese su número de Ticket:</h3>
            <form action="/buscar_ticket" method="POST">
                <input type="number" name="ticket" placeholder="Ej. 1 o 2" required style="padding: 8px; font-size: 16px; width: 60%;"><br><br>
                <button type="submit" style="background-color: #004b87; color: white; border: none; padding: 10px 15px; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer;">Consultar</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>